    "title": "Tiffany Stratton Pushed The Limits With Eye-Catching Coachella Outfit That Had Everyone Sneaking a Peak [PHOTOS] - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Orlando Silva ,\n1 hours ago\nTiffany Stratton. (Photo via Instagram) WWE superstar Tiffany Stratton won’t be on WrestleMania 42 this weekend, but she spent some time at another iconic event, where she turned plenty of heads.\nThe former WWE Women’s champion, who fought Charlotte Flair at the biggest stage last year, won’t be featured on the card this weekend. She still found a way to have a good time in a crowded environment where fans focused their attention on her.\nOn Monday, Stratton shared a series of pictures with her Coachella outfit on Instagram. The festival’s first weekend gathered hundreds of thousands of fans, including one of the top wrestlers in the women’s division.\nFans In Awe Of Tiffany Stratton’s Coachella Pictures Tiffany-Stratton (Photo via Tiffany-Stratton/Instagram) Naturally, many people sent positive comments to Stratton. They didn’t mince words when praising her beauty.\n“Coachella looks good on yo ,” one fan said.\n“Okay, I love everything about this. You’re a rockstar,” another fan said.\n“keep the chella pics coming,” a third fan added.\n“This is such a great look,” a fourth fan said.\n“Lord have mercy,” a fifth fan wrote.\n“Is it me or her looks with the bandana is giving me Ashley massaro vibes ?” a sixth fan asked.\nStratton has gotten used to causing a stir on social media.\nThe post originally published on .",
